{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Ch7EPJRhx8cpfXMZaCCuP","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Before I draft this, a few questions. Your answers will change what the speech says:\n\n1. **What exactly is the commission voting on tonight?** For example a rezoning, a conditional use permit, a variance, or a site plan approval. The speech should end by asking for that specific vote.\n2. **What objections have neighbors or commissioners raised so far?** Traffic, parking, density, \"neighborhood character,\" something else? The 3 minutes should go to answering the objections that are actually in the room.\n3. **Does the plan do anything about the Alder and 4th intersection?** For example signal timing, a turn lane, or a payment toward road improvements. If not, do you know how many other intersections in the county already run at a D? The C-to-D drop is the strongest fact against you. As an Alder Road neighbor you're in a good position to address it head-on, but I need to know what's real.\n4. **Are you speaking as a church member, as a neighbor, or both?** And is anyone from the church presenting the project formally, so you don't need to repeat their numbers?\n5. **Is there a true personal detail you'd want included?** For example someone you know who's waited for housing, or what you've seen on Alder Road in 19 years. If not, that's fine. I'll stick to the facts you gave me and won't invent anything.\n\nIf you don't know some of these, just say so and I'll write around them."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4,"cache_creation_input_tokens":251,"cache_read_input_tokens":9538,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":251},"output_tokens":10,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id